{
  "dn15:0.1": "Dīgha Nikāya 15 ",
  "dn15:0.2": "Mahānidānasutta ",
  "dn15:1.0": "1. Paṭiccasamuppāda ",
  "dn15:1.1": "Evaṁ me sutaṁ—",
  "dn15:1.2": "ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā kurūsu viharati kammāsadhammaṁ nāma kurūnaṁ nigamo. ",
  "dn15:1.3": "Atha kho āyasmā ānando yena bhagavā tenupasaṅkami, upasaṅkamitvā bhagavantaṁ abhivādetvā ekamantaṁ nisīdi. Ekamantaṁ nisinno kho āyasmā ānando bhagavantaṁ etadavoca: ",
  "dn15:1.4": "“acchariyaṁ, bhante, abbhutaṁ, bhante. ",
  "dn15:1.5": "Yāva gambhīro cāyaṁ, bhante, paṭiccasamuppādo gambhīrāvabhāso ca, atha ca pana me uttānakuttānako viya khāyatī”ti. ",
  "dn15:1.6": "“Mā hevaṁ, ānanda, avaca, mā hevaṁ, ānanda, avaca. ",
  "dn15:1.7": "Gambhīro cāyaṁ, ānanda, paṭiccasamuppādo gambhīrāvabhāso ca. ",
  "dn15:1.8": "Etassa, ānanda, dhammassa ananubodhā appaṭivedhā evamayaṁ pajā tantākulakajātā kulagaṇṭhikajātā muñjapabbajabhūtā apāyaṁ duggatiṁ vinipātaṁ saṁsāraṁ nātivattati. ",
  "dn15:2.1": "‘Atthi idappaccayā jarāmaraṇan’ti iti puṭṭhena satā, ānanda, atthītissa vacanīyaṁ. ",
  "dn15:2.2": "‘Kiṁpaccayā jarāmaraṇan’ti iti ce vadeyya, ‘jātipaccayā jarāmaraṇan’ti iccassa vacanīyaṁ. ",
  "dn15:2.3": "‘Atthi idappaccayā jātī’ti iti puṭṭhena satā, ānanda, atthītissa vacanīyaṁ. ",
  "dn15:2.4": "‘Kiṁpaccayā jātī’ti iti ce vadeyya, ‘bhavapaccayā jātī’ti iccassa vacanīyaṁ. ",
  